ng:p029","quote":"膠東王賢立十四年卒，謚為哀王。子慶為王。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-059","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p030","quote":"六安王慶，以元狩二年用膠東康王子為六安王。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-059","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong"}],"rationale":"寄少子慶封六安王；賢立十四年卒後子慶為膠東王。父系位置、所承爵國與敘事次序不同，兩位慶不按同名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p028","text":"膠東康王寄，以孝景中二年用皇子為膠東王。二十八年卒。淮南王謀反時，寄微聞其事，私作樓車鏃矢戰守備，候淮南之起。及吏治淮南之事，辭出之。寄於上最親，意傷之，發病而死，不敢置後，於是上（問）［聞］。寄有長子者名賢，母無寵；少子名慶，母愛幸，寄常欲立之，為不次，因有過，遂無言。上憐之，乃以賢為膠東王奉康王嗣，而封慶於故衡山地，為六安王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0000","start":0,"end":5,"surface":"膠東康王寄","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAM","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"膠東王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAM","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、未名皇帝或未定指代；不補未見姓名、親屬成員或確定身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"寄","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAM","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"寄","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAM","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、未名皇帝或未定指代；不補未見姓名、親屬成員或確定身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m028-0089","start":89,"end":90,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolve